Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What if everything you thought you knew about Every night, a lonely boy wished he could stop time.  One day, his wish came true.  He could freeze everything around him… the rain, the wind, even people.  At first, he felt like a god.  He used his power to win fights, avoid pain, and escape every problem.  But slowly, he noticed something terrifying.  Every time he stopped time, someone he loved forgot a memory of him.  First, his best friend forgot their childhood.  Then, his mother forgot his name.  Desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered…  “I don't need a world that stops for me. I just want a world where I can stay with you.”  He let time flow again.  And for the first time in his life…  He chose to grow older instead of living forever. was only the surface of a much deeper reality? When examining Every night, a lonely boy wished he could stop time.  One day, his wish came true.  He could freeze everything around him… the rain, the wind, even people.  At first, he felt like a god.  He used his power to win fights, avoid pain, and escape every problem.  But slowly, he noticed something terrifying.  Every time he stopped time, someone he loved forgot a memory of him.  First, his best friend forgot their childhood.  Then, his mother forgot his name.  Desperate, he stopped time one final time and whispered…  “I don't need a world that stops for me. I just want a world where I can stay with you.”  He let time flow again.  And for the first time in his life…  He chose to grow older instead of living forever., every detail offers a glimpse into a much larger puzzle.
